      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would use `k_panic()` or `k_oops()` for rebooting the system. For terminating the process I would use `k_thread_abort(k_current_get())`.\n\nBy the way, I really recommend to dig into Zephyr codebase and find difference between these.",
